li> <li>२३. राजा गढ़ छेका खंड</li> <li>२४. गंधर्वसेन मंत्री खंड</li> <li>२५. रत्‍नसेन सूली खंड</li> <li>२६. रत्‍नसेन पद्मावती विवाह खंड</li> <li>२७. पद्मावती रत्‍नसेन भेंट खंड</li> <li>२८. रत्‍नसेन साथी खंड</li> <li>२९. षड् ऋतु वर्णन खंड</li> <li>३०. नागमती वियोग खंड</li> <li>३१. नागमती संदेश खंड</li> <li>३२. रत्‍नसेन बिदाई खंड</li> <li>३३. देशयात्रा खंड</li> <li>३४. लक्ष्मी समुद्र खंड</li> <li>३५. चित्तौर आगमन खंड</li> <li>३६. नागमती पद्मावती विवाद खंड</li> <li>३७. रत्‍नसेन संतति खंड</li> <li>३८. राघवचेतन देशनिकाला खंड</li> <li>३९. राघवचेतन दिल्ली गमन खंड</li> <li>४०. स्त्री भेद वर्णन खंड</li> <li>४१. पद्मावती रूप चर्चा खंड</li> <li>४२. बादशाह चढ़ाई खंड</li> <li>४३. राजा बादशाह युद्ध खंड</li> <li>४४. राजा बादशाह मेल खंड</li> <li>४५. बादशाह भोज खंड</li> <li>४६. चित्तौरगढ़ वर्णन खंड</li> <li>४७. रत्‍नसेन बंधन खंड</li> <li>४८. पद्मावती नागमती विलाप खंड</li> <li>४९. देवपाल दूती खंड</li> <li>५०. बादशाह दूती खंड</li> <li>५१. पद्मावती, गोरा बादल संवाद खंड</li> <li>५२. गोरा बादल युद्धयात्रा खंड</li> <li>५३. गोरा बादल युद्ध खंड</li> <li>५४. बंधन मोक्ष; पद्मावती मिलन खंड</li> <li>५५. रत्‍नसेन देवपाल युद्ध खंड</li> <li>५६. राजा रत्‍नसेन बैकुंठवास खंड</li> <li>५७. पद्मावती नागमती सती खंड</li> <li>५८. उपसंहार</li> </ul> <p>Chapters</p> <ul> <li>अखरावट</li> <li>आखिरी कलाम</li> </ul>"},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/index.html#about-this-book","title":"About this book","text":"<p>Malik Muhammad Jāyasī (sixteenth century), a Sufi of Jāyas in Awadh, told the love of Ratnasen of Chittor for Padmāvatī of Siṃhala, and Alāuddīn’s siege of Chittor, as an allegory of the soul’s search for God, in Awadhi dohā-caupāī verse. This is the Granthāvalī edited by Ramchandra Shukla (1884–1941) for the Nāgarīpracāriṇī Sabhā (1924), with his long critical introduction, the 58 cantos of the Padmāvat and two shorter poems, as proofread on Hindi Wikisource.</p> <p>From Wikisource · Public domain</p><p>Malik Muhammad Jāyasī, Jāyasī Granthāvalī, edited by Ramchandra Shukla (1884–1941), Kashi Nagari Pracharini Sabha, 1924, as proofread on Hindi Wikisource by its contributors. This book is not stored in this library: each chapter is read from Wikisource when it is opened, shown in this library's format, and ends with its own attribution. Licence: Public domain. Modified: converted to this format.</p>"},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-1.html","title":"मलिक मुहम्मद जायसी","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-10.html","title":"प्रेम तत्व","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-11.html","title":"प्रबंध कल्पना","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-12.html","title":"संबंध निर्वाह","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-13.html","title":"कवि द्वारा वस्तुवर्णन","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-14.html","title":"पात्र द्वारा भावव्यंजना","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-15.html","title":"अलंकार","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-16.html","title":"स्वभावचित्रण","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-17.html","title":"मत और सिद्धांत","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-18.html","title":"जायसी का रहस्यवाद","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-19.html","title":"सूक्तियाँ","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-2.html","title":"प्रेम गाथा की परंपरा","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-20.html","title":"फुटकल प्रसंग","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-21.html","title":"जायसी की जानकारी","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-22.html","title":"जायसी की भाषा","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-23.html","title":"संक्षिप्त समीक्षा","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-24.html","title":"१. स्तुति खंड","text":""},{"location":"classics/jayasi-granthavali/chapter-25.html","title":"२. सिंहलदीप बर